    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalobobusuku inkosi yaswela ubuthongo; yasisithi kakulethwe kiyo ugwalo lwezindaba zensuku ngensuku, yasilubalelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakulotshiwe kulo ukuthi uMoridekayi wayebike ngoBigithana loTereshi abathenwa ababili benkosi, ababelinde umnyango wesigodlo, ababenze icebo lokubulala inkosi uAhasuweru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.2.21+EST.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esta 2:21–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi: UMoridekayi wanikwa udumo bani lobukhulu bani ngalokhu na? Inceku zenkosi ezazikhona zayitshela ukuthi uMoridekayi kenzelwanga lutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasibuza isithi: Ngubani loyana osegumeni na? UHamani wayesand’ ukungena egumeni elingaphandle kwesigodlo ukucela enkosini ukuba uMoridekayi aphanyekwe ogodweni ayemlungisele lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zenkosi zayiphendula zathi: NguHamani loyana omi laphaya. Inkosi yathi kangene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHamani wangena, inkosi yathi kuye: Uzakwenzelwani lowomuntu inkosi efisa ukumnika udumo na? UHamani wasezikhumbulela esithi: Kambe kungaba ngubani inkosi engafisa ukumnika udumo kulami na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi enkosini: Lowomuntu inkosi efisa ukumnika udumo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kalethelwe izambatho zobukhosi ezigqokwa yinkosi uqobo, lebhiza eligadwa yinkosi elilomqhele wobukhosi ekhanda lalo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lezozambatho lalelobhiza kunikezwe komunye wezikhulu zenkosi ohloniphekayo kakhulu, ukuba agqokise lowomuntu inkosi efisa ukumnika udumo, amkhokhele egade ibhiza adabule igceke lomuzi, amemeze athi: Bonani okwenzelwe lowomuntu inkosi efisa ukumnika udumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kuHamani: Letha izambatho lebhiza masiyane njengokutsho kwakho, konke lokhu ukwenzele uMoridekayi umJuda okhona lapha esigodlweni, ungatshiyi lokukodwa kukho konke lokho okukhulumileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHamani wasethatha izambatho lebhiza, wagqokisa uMoridekayi, wamkhokhela uMoridekayi ekhwele ibhiza, wadabula igceke lomuzi ehamba ememeza esithi: Bonani okwenzelwe lowomuntu inkosi efisa ukumnika udumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebuyela uMoridekayi esigodlweni, loHamani waya ekhaya masinyane elila embomboze ikhanda lakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHamani watshela uZereshi umkakhe labo bonke abangane bakhe konke okumehleleyo. Abangane bakhe loZereshi umkakhe bathi kuye: Uba uMoridekayi osusiwa phambi kwakhe engowesizwe sabaJuda kawuyikumahlula, uzakukwahlula wena impela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho besakhuluma loHamani, kwafika abathenwa benkosi, bamthatha uHamani masinyane, baya laye edilini elalenziwe nguEsta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
